# Trims the API function bundle: the Streamlit app and the scraper never run in
# it, and shipping them only makes it larger.
#
# This file is at the repository root, so it applies to *both* Vercel projects
# in this repo - including the frontend, which is rooted at web/. Listing web/
# here deleted it before the build ran and produced a deployment with no output
# at all. It stays out of the list; 404KB of source against the 12MB of images
# below is not worth a second broken project.
#
# static/ is deliberately absent: the API serves the catalog images, because the
# frontend is its own project rooted at web/ and cannot read a directory outside
# that root. The CDN caches them after the first hit.
tests/
.github/
.streamlit/
scripts/
app.py
catalog_admin.py
storm_scraper.py
dedupe_products.py
download_images.py
optimize_images.py
label_cleaning.py
sync_catalog.py
wipe_orders.py
catalog.py
*.csv
*.db
